><div class='field full'><button class='primary' type='submit'>Submit request</button></div></form></div></article><article class='card'><div class='card-head'><h2>Open requests</h2></div><div class='card-body'><div class='account-row'><div><strong>SR-1042</strong><small>Invoice cost allocation</small></div><span class='badge warn' style='margin-left:auto'>Awaiting reply</span></div><div class='account-row'><div><strong>SR-1038</strong><small>New user access</small></div><span class='badge success' style='margin-left:auto'>In progress</span></div></div></article></div></section>\n<section class='page' id='repository'><div class='heading'><div><h1>GitHub repository</h1><p>Source control, governance, and delivery readiness.</p></div><button class='secondary action' data-message='Prototype: external repository links are disabled'>Open in GitHub ↗</button></div><article class='card repo-hero'><div class='repo-logo'>⌘</div><div><h2>northstar/customer-portal</h2><p>Private repository · main branch protected</p></div><div class='repo-meta'><div><strong>24</strong><span>COMMITS</span></div><div><strong>6</strong><span>CHECKS</span></div><div><strong>0</strong><span>ALERTS</span></div></div></article><div class='grid stats' style='margin-top:18px'><article class='card stat'><div class='stat-top'>Branch protection<span class='badge success'>Enabled</span></div><strong>2 reviews</strong><span class='trend'>Required before merge</span></article><article class='card stat'><div class='stat-top'>Security scanning<span class='badge success'>Passing</span></div><strong>0 alerts</strong><span class='trend'>Code and secrets scanned</span></article><article class='card stat'><div class='stat-top'>Last workflow<span class='badge fail'>Failed</span></div><strong>#148</strong><span style='font-size:12px;color:var(--danger)'>Azure deployment</span></article><article class='card stat'><div class='stat-top'>Artifact<span class='badge success'>Verified</span></div><strong>v1.8.3</strong><span class='trend'>Immutable build</span></article></div><article class='card table-wrap'><table class='table'><thead><tr><th>Workflow</th><th>Trigger</th><th>Commit</th><th>Duration</th><th>Status</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td><strong>Deploy production</strong></td><td>Release v1.8.3</td><td>8e32ad1</td><td>6m 42s</td><td><span class='badge fail'>Failed</span></td></tr><tr><td><strong>Pull request checks</strong></td><td>PR #81</td><td>8e32ad1</td><td>4m 11s</td><td><span class='badge success'>Passed</span></td></tr><tr><td><strong>Security scan</strong></td><td>Schedule</td><td>7a90f26</td><td>2m 38s</td><td><span class='badge success'>Passed</span></td></tr></tbody></table></article></section>\n<section class='page' id='deployment'><div class='heading'><div><h1>Azure deployment</h1><p>Production release v1.8.3 · West Europe · App Service</p></div><button class='primary nav-link' data-target='diagnostics'>View diagnostics</button></div><article class='card'><div class='card-head'><h2>Deployment pipeline</h2><span class='badge fail'><span class='dot'></span>Action required</span></div><div class='pipeline'><div class='stage'><div class='stage-circle'>✓</div><h3>Authenticate</h3><small>12s</small></div><div class='connector'></div><div class='stage'><div class='stage-circle'>✓</div><h3>Build</h3><small>2m 08s</small></div><div class='connector'></div><div class='stage'><div class='stage-circle'>✓</div><h3>Test</h3><small>3m 17s</small></div><div class='connector'></div><div class='stage'><div class='stage-circle'>✓</div><h3>Deploy</h3><small>58s</small></div><div class='connector fail'></div><div class='stage fail'><div class='stage-circle'>!</div><h3>Health check</h3><small>Failed</small></div></div></article><article class='card incident'><div class='incident-top'><div class='incident-icon'>!</div><div><h2>Deployment health verification failed</h2><p>The artifact deployed successfully, but the application did not answer on the expected port within 230 seconds.</p></div><div class='incident-actions'><button class='secondary nav-link' data-target='diagnostics'>Investigate</button><button class='danger-btn action' data-message='Rollback simulation started'>Roll back</button></div></div></article><div class='grid stats' style='margin-top:18px'><article class='card stat'><div class='stat-top'>Environment</div><strong>Production</strong><span style='font-size:12px;color:var(--muted)'>customer-portal-prod</span></article><article class='card stat'><div class='stat-top'>Last healthy</div><strong>v1.8.2</strong><span class='trend'>May 28 · 14:32 UTC</span></article><article class='card stat'><div class='stat-top'>Availability</div><strong>99.98%</strong><span class='trend'>Previous 30 days</span></article><article class='card stat'><div class='stat-top'>Live traffic</div><strong>v1.8.2</strong><span class='trend'>Protected by slot swap</span></article></div></section>\n<section class='page' id='diagnostics'><div class='heading'><div><h1>Failure diagnostics</h1><p>Evidence-backed root cause analysis for workflow run #148.</p></div><button class='primary action' data-message='Remediation workflow queued in this prototype'>Apply correction</button></div><div class='grid rca-grid'><article class='card'><div class='card-head'><h2>Root cause</h2><span class='badge fail'>Confirmed</span></div><div class='card-body'><p><strong>Incorrect App Service startup port configuration.</strong></p><p style='color:var(--muted);font-size:13px'>The application listens on port <strong>3000</strong>, while the App Service configuration expected port <strong>8080</strong>. The process started, but the platform health probe could not reach it.</p><div class='evidence'><span class='red'>ERROR</span> Health probe failed: connection refused :8080<br>INFO Server listening on 0.0.0.0:<span class='green'>3000</span><br>INFO Artifact: customer-portal-v1.8.3<br>INFO Correlation: dep-148-f7a2</div></div></article><article class='card'><div class='card-head'><h2>Durable correction</h2><span class='badge success'>Ready</span></div><div class='card-body'><ul class='checklist'><li><span class='check'>✓</span><span>Set application to use the platform-provided <strong>PORT</strong> environment variable.</span></li><li><span class='check'>✓</span><span>Add startup validation that logs the effective host and port.</span></li><li><span class='check'>✓</span><span>Add a staging smoke test against <strong>/health</strong> before slot promotion.</span></li><li><span class='check'>✓</span><span>Keep production on healthy artifact v1.8.2 until validation passes.</span></li></ul></div></article></div><article class='card' style='margin-top:18px'><div class='card-head'><h2>Validation plan</h2><span class='badge warn'>Pending approval</span></div><div class='card-body'><div class='grid stats' style='margin:0'><div><strong>1. Deploy to staging</strong><p style='font-size:12px;color:var(--muted)'>Use immutable artifact v1.8.3-r1.</p></div><div><strong>2. Verify health</strong><p style='font-size:12px;color:var(--muted)'>Confirm startup, identity, and database.</p></div><div><strong>3. Run smoke tests</strong><p style='font-size:12px;color:var(--muted)'>Exercise login and account views.</p></div><div><strong>4. Promote safely</strong><p style='font-size:12px;color:var(--muted)'>Swap slots after approval.</p></div></div></div></article></section>\n</div>\n</main>\n</div>\n<div class='toast' id='toast' role='status' aria-live='polite'></div>\n<script>\nconst pages=[...document.querySelectorAll('.page')],nav=[...document.querySelectorAll('.nav button')],sidebar=document.getElementById('sidebar'),overlay=document.getElementById('overlay'),toast=document.getElementById('toast');\nfunction showPage(id){pages.forEach(p=>p.classList.toggle('active',p.id===id));nav.forEach(b=>b.classList.toggle('active',b.dataset.page===id));sidebar.classList.remove('open');overlay.classList.remove('show');window.scrollTo({top:0,behavior:'smooth'});}\nnav.forEach(b=>b.addEventListener('click',()=>showPage(b.dataset.page)));\ndocument.querySelectorAll('.nav-link').forEach(b=>b.addEventListener('click',()=>showPage(b.dataset.target)));\ndocument.getElementById('menuBtn').addEventListener('click',()=>{sidebar.classList.toggle('open');overlay.classList.toggle('show')});overlay.addEventListener('click',()=>{sidebar.classList.remove('open');overlay.classList.remove('show')});\nfunction notify(message){toast.textContent=message;toast.classList.add('show');clearTimeout(window.toastTimer);window.toastTimer=setTimeout(()=>toast.classList.remove('show'),2800)}\ndocument.querySelectorAll('.action').forEach(b=>b.addEventListener('click',()=>notify(b.dataset.message)));\ndocument.getElementById('supportForm').addEventListener('submit',e=>{e.preventDefault();notify('Support request SR-1051 created');e.target.reset()});\n</script>\n</body>\n</html>"
